  "question": {
    "text": "The area of the region <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo></math>in square units<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>)</mo></math> above the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis bounded by the curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and the tangent to the curve at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;"
  },
