  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given curve is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;and at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Also,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>We know&nbsp;that the equation of the tangent to a curve&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;at a point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence, the equation of the tangent to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>To find the point where this line cuts the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis, put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;to get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Thus, the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Now, the graph for the given information is</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0151_6bd8fca092a1.png\" style=\"width: 221px; height: 250px;\" /></p><p>And, the required Area<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>log</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sec</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>log</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sec</mi><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sec</mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>log</mi><mfenced><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>log</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;sq units.</p>"
  }
